# W30b, b (k10). First its own trip into dng205b1 (COUNTER 2 = 205, as a's) and home by the gate disc. The lobby's
# return mat (stagML11 mate02) takes a player to the stage of his last Security Gate (dng205b2 point 2, 19.30.1 fact 4):
# its departure is posted by the depart action (the return mat needs the gate, which only dng205b2's GENE-03 wave
# powers). While a's Dry Land instance has never been at dng205b2, b's arrival there is a NEW of its own (I1a: a's row
# greyed "Story not here yet"); home again by its gate disc, and after a reached dng205b2 the next arrival there joins a
# without leaving a's story.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@40
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
depart dng205b1 0 until stage=dng205b1,control
log b was in dng205
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control fail epoch>=@200
idle until epoch>=@240
depart dng205b2 2 until stage=dng205b2,control
log b alone on dng205b2
idle until frames>=300 fail present>=2
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control
log b home again
idle until epoch>=@320
depart dng205b2 2 until stage=dng205b2,control
idle until present=2,sealed>=600 fail epoch>=@600
log b joined a on dng205b2
